{"id":5,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","Crystal"],"text":"If it becomes agitated during battle, it spouts intense flames, incinerating its surroundings."},{"games":["Sword","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It has a barbaric nature. In battle, it whips its fiery tail around and slashes away with sharp claws."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"Tough fights could excite this Pokémon. When excited, it may breathe out bluish-white flames."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Charmeleon mercilessly destroys its foes using its sharp claws. If it encounters a strong foe, it turns aggressive. In this excited state, the flame at the tip of its tail flares with a bluish white color."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen"],"text":"When it swings its burning tail, it elevates the air temperature to unbearably high levels."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"It lashes about with its tail to knock down its foe. It then tears up the fallen opponent with sharp claws."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"In the rocky mountains where Charmeleon live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It is very hotheaded by nature, so it constantly seeks opponents. It calms down only when it wins."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Without pity, its sharp claws destroy foes. If it encounters a strong enemy, it becomes agitated, and the flame on its tail flares with a bluish white color."},{"games":["Yellow"],"text":"Tough fights could excite this POKéMON. When excited, it may blow out bluish- white flames."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"When it swings its burning tail, it elevates the temperature to unbearably high levels."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Blaze","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Fire-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Solar Power","hidden":true,"description":"In harsh sunlight, the Pokémon's Sp. Atk stat is boosted, but its HP decr